---
type Rule = [string, string];
const groups: [string, Rule[]][] = [
  ['Heat', [
    ['Battery temperature', 'Hottest battery sensor at 43 °C for 60 s. This is the one that matters in a bag.'],
    ['CPU', '60 s average at 102 °C for 2 min. Clears 10 °C lower.'],
    ['GPU', '60 s average at 100 °C for 2 min.'],
    ['Thermal pressure', 'macOS reports serious for 5 min, or critical once.'],
    ['Battery heating up', 'Up 2 °C in 5 min with the lid closed on battery. Off by default.'],
  ]],
  ['Power and network', [
    ['Battery charge', 'Below 20% and not charging. Clears at 30% or on the charger.'],
    ['No network', 'No usable route for 15 min.'],
    ['Sensor failure', 'No valid temperature for 60 s. Unknown heat counts as hot.'],
  ]],
  ['Time', [
    ['Time cap', '8 h in one run.'],
    ['Lid on battery', 'Closed and unplugged for 90 min.'],
    ['Schedule', 'Outside your hours for that weekday. Up to three windows a day.'],
    ['Idle', 'CPU under 10% for 15 min with the lid closed.'],
    ['Watched process', 'No claude process for 20 min. Off by default.'],
  ]],
];
---
<section class="block" id="rules">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>When it lets go</h2>
    <p class="lede">The first rule that trips turns sleep back on. Every limit is a setting, these are the defaults. Temperatures have to stay over the limit for a while, so one spike does not end a run.</p>
    <div class="groups">
      {groups.map(([name, rules]) => (
        <div class="group">
          <h3>{name}</h3>
          <dl>
            {rules.map(([t, d]) => <div><dt>{t}</dt><dd>{d}</dd></div>)}
          </dl>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .groups { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; margin-top: 56px; }
  .group { border-top: 1px solid #2c3c40; padding-top: 18px; }
  .group h3 { font: 600 13px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 22px; }
  dl { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  dt { font-weight: 600; }
  dd { margin: 2px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .groups { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; } }
</style>
